      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"29\" type=\"品\">29 十忍品</cb:mulu>\r\n<milestone n=\"45\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b02\">0237b02</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b03\">0237b03</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b04\">0237b04</span><cb:juan n=\"045\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"045\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>大方廣佛華嚴經</title>卷<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0237b01\"/>第四十五</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b05\">0237b05</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b06\">0237b06</span><byline><anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0237b02\"/>于闐國<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0237b03\"/>三藏實叉難陀<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0237b04\"/>奉　制譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b07\">0237b07</span><cb:div type=\"pin\"><cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"30\" type=\"品\">30 阿僧祇品</cb:mulu><head>阿僧祇品第三十</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b08\">0237b08</span><p>爾時，心王菩薩白佛言：「世尊！諸佛如來演說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b09\">0237b09</span>阿僧祇無量、無邊、無等、不可數、不可稱、不可思、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b10\">0237b10</span>不可量、不可說、不可說不可說。世尊！云何阿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b11\">0237b11</span>僧祇乃至不可說不可說耶？」佛告心王菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b12\">0237b12</span>言：「善哉善哉！善男子！汝今為欲令諸世間入\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b13\">0237b13</span>佛所知數量之義，而問如來、應、正等覺。善男\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b14\">0237b14</span>子！諦聽諦聽！善思念之！當為汝說。」時，心王\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b15\">0237b15</span>菩薩唯然受教。</p><p>佛言：「善男子！一百洛叉為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b16\">0237b16</span>一俱胝，俱胝俱胝為一阿庾多，阿庾多阿庾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b17\">0237b17</span>多為一那由他，那由他那由他為一頻<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0237b1701\">婆【CB】【麗-CB】，波【大】</span><app n=\"0237b1701\"><p class=\"lg\">婆<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0703c13</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">波</rdg></app>羅，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b18\">0237b18</span>頻<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0237b1801\">婆【CB】【麗-CB】，波【大】</span><app n=\"0237b1801\"><p class=\"lg\">婆<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0703c14</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">波</rdg></app>羅頻<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0237b1802\">婆【CB】【麗-CB】，波【大】</span><app n=\"0237b1802\"><p class=\"lg\">婆<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0703c14</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">波</rdg></app>羅為一矜羯羅，矜羯羅矜羯羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b19\">0237b19</span>為一阿伽羅，阿伽羅阿伽羅為一最勝，最勝\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b20\">0237b20</span>最勝為一摩婆<note place=\"inline\">上聲<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0237001\">〔呼〕－【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0237001\">呼【大】，〔－〕【明】</span><app n=\"0237001\"><p class=\"lg\">呼</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app></note>羅，摩婆羅摩婆羅為一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b21\">0237b21</span>阿婆<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0237002\">上＋（聲）夾註【明】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0237002\">上【大】＊，上<note place=\"inline\">聲</span>【明】＊</note><app n=\"0237002\"><p class=\"lg\"><note place=\"inline\">上</note></lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\"><note place=\"inline\">上聲</note></rdg></app>羅，阿婆羅阿婆羅為一多婆<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0237b05\"/><note place=\"inline\">上</note>羅，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b22\">0237b22</span>多婆羅多婆羅為一界分，界分界分為一普\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b23\">0237b23</span>摩，普摩普摩為一禰摩，禰摩禰摩為一阿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b24\">0237b24</span>婆<note place=\"inline\">上</note>鈐，阿婆鈐阿婆鈐為一彌伽<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0237b06\"/><note place=\"inline\">上</note>婆，彌伽\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b25\">0237b25</span>婆彌伽婆為一毘攞伽，毘攞伽毘攞伽為一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b26\">0237b26</span>毘伽<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0237b07\"/><note place=\"inline\">上</note>婆，毘伽婆毘伽婆為一僧羯邏摩，僧\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b27\">0237b27</span>羯邏摩僧羯邏摩為一毘薩羅，毘薩羅毘薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b28\">0237b28</span>羅為一毘贍婆，毘贍婆毘贍婆為一毘盛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237b29\">0237b29</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0237003\">〔上〕－【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0237003\">上【大】，〔－〕【明】</span><app n=\"0237003\"><p class=\"lg\"><note place=\"inline\">上</note></lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>伽，毘盛伽毘盛伽為一毘素陀，毘素陀毘\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c01\">0237c01</span>素陀為一毘婆訶，毘婆訶毘婆訶為一毘薄\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c02\">0237c02</span>底，毘薄底毘薄底為一毘佉擔，毘佉擔毘佉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c03\">0237c03</span>擔為一稱量，稱量稱量為一一持，一持一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c04\">0237c04</span>持為一異路，異路異路為一顛倒，顛倒顛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c05\">0237c05</span>倒為一三末耶，三末耶三末耶為一毘覩羅，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c06\">0237c06</span>毘覩羅毘覩羅為一奚婆<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0237c01\"/><note place=\"inline\">上</note>羅，奚婆羅奚婆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c07\">0237c07</span>羅為一伺察，伺察伺察為一周廣，周廣周廣\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c08\">0237c08</span>為一高出，高出高出為一最妙，最妙最妙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c09\">0237c09</span>為一泥羅婆，泥羅婆泥羅婆為一訶理婆，訶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c10\">0237c10</span>理婆訶理婆為一一動，一動一動為一訶理\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c11\">0237c11</span>蒲，訶理蒲訶理蒲為一訶理三，訶理三訶理\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c12\">0237c12</span>三為一奚魯伽，奚魯伽奚魯伽為一達攞步\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c13\">0237c13</span>陀，達攞步陀達攞步陀為一訶魯那，訶魯那\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c14\">0237c14</span>訶魯那為一摩魯陀，摩魯陀摩魯陀為一懺\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c15\">0237c15</span>慕陀，懺慕陀懺慕陀為一瑿攞陀，瑿攞陀瑿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c16\">0237c16</span>攞陀為一摩魯摩，摩魯摩摩魯摩為一調伏，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c17\">0237c17</span>調伏調伏為一離憍慢，離憍慢離憍慢為一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c18\">0237c18</span>不動，不動不動為一極量，極量極量為一阿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c19\">0237c19</span>麼怛羅，阿麼怛羅阿麼怛羅為一勃麼怛羅，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c20\">0237c20</span>勃麼怛羅勃麼怛羅為一伽麼怛羅，伽麼怛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c21\">0237c21</span>羅伽麼怛羅為一那麼怛羅，那麼怛羅那麼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c22\">0237c22</span>怛羅為一奚麼怛羅，奚麼怛羅奚麼怛羅為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c23\">0237c23</span>一鞞麼怛羅，鞞麼怛羅鞞麼怛羅為一鉢羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c24\">0237c24</span>麼怛羅，鉢羅麼怛羅鉢羅麼怛羅為一尸婆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c25\">0237c25</span>麼怛羅，尸婆麼怛羅尸婆麼怛羅為一翳羅，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c26\">0237c26</span>翳羅翳羅為一薜羅，薜羅薜羅為一諦羅，諦\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c27\">0237c27</span>羅諦羅為一偈羅，偈羅偈羅為一窣步羅，窣\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c28\">0237c28</span>步羅窣步羅為一泥羅，泥羅泥羅為一計羅，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0237c29\">0237c29</span>計羅計羅為一細羅，細羅細羅為一睥羅，睥\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a01\">0238a01</span>羅睥羅為一謎羅，謎羅謎羅為一娑<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0238001\">攞＝欏【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0238001\">攞【大】＊，欏【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0238001\"><p class=\"lg\">攞</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">欏</rdg></app>荼，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a02\">0238a02</span>娑<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0238001\"><p class=\"lg\">攞</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">欏</rdg></app>荼娑<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0238001\"><p class=\"lg\">攞</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">欏</rdg></app>荼為一謎魯陀，謎魯陀謎魯\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a03\">0238a03</span>陀為一契魯陀，契魯陀契魯陀為一摩覩羅，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a04\">0238a04</span>摩覩羅摩覩羅為一娑母羅，娑母羅娑母羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a05\">0238a05</span>為一阿野娑，阿野娑阿野娑為一迦麼羅，迦\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a06\">0238a06</span>麼羅迦麼羅為一摩伽婆，摩伽婆摩伽婆為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a07\">0238a07</span>一阿怛羅，阿怛羅阿怛羅為一醯魯耶，醯魯\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a08\">0238a08</span>耶醯魯耶為一薜魯婆，薜魯婆薜魯婆為一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a09\">0238a09</span>羯羅波，羯羅波羯羅波為一訶婆婆，訶婆婆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a10\">0238a10</span>訶婆婆為一毘婆<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0238a03\"/><note place=\"inline\">上</note>羅，毘婆羅毘婆羅為一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a11\">0238a11</span>那婆<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0238a04\"/><note place=\"inline\">上</note>羅，那婆羅那婆羅為一摩<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0238001\"><p class=\"lg\">攞</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">欏</rdg></app>羅，摩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a12\">0238a12</span><app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0238001\"><p class=\"lg\">攞</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">欏</rdg></app>羅摩<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0238001\"><p class=\"lg\">攞</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">欏</rdg></app>羅為一娑婆<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0238a08\"/><note place=\"inline\">上</note>羅，娑婆羅娑婆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a13\">0238a13</span>羅為一迷攞普，迷攞普迷攞普為一者麼羅，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a14\">0238a14</span>者麼羅者麼羅為一馱麼羅，馱麼羅馱麼羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a15\">0238a15</span>為一鉢攞麼陀，鉢攞麼陀鉢攞麼陀為一毘\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a16\">0238a16</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0238a1601\">伽【CB】【麗-CB】，迦【大】</span><app n=\"0238a1601\"><p class=\"lg\">伽<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0704b22</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">迦</rdg></app>摩，毘伽摩毘<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0238a1602\">伽【CB】【麗-CB】，迦【大】</span><app n=\"0238a1602\"><p class=\"lg\">伽<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0704b22</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">迦</rdg></app>摩為一烏波跋多，烏波跋\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a17\">0238a17</span>多烏波跋多為一演說，演說演說為一無盡，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a18\">0238a18</span>無盡無盡為一出生，出生出生為一無我，無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a19\">0238a19</span>我無我為一阿畔多，阿畔多阿畔多為一青\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a20\">0238a20</span>蓮華，青蓮華青蓮華為一鉢頭摩，鉢頭摩鉢\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a21\">0238a21</span>頭摩為一僧祇，僧祇僧祇為一趣，趣趣為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a22\">0238a22</span>一至，至至為一阿僧祇，阿僧祇阿僧祇為一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a23\">0238a23</span>阿僧祇轉，阿僧祇轉阿僧祇轉為一無量，無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a24\">0238a24</span>量無量為一無量轉，無量轉無量轉為一無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a25\">0238a25</span>邊，無邊無邊為一無邊轉，無邊轉無邊轉為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a26\">0238a26</span>一無等，無等無等為一無等轉，無等轉無等\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a27\">0238a27</span>轉為一不可數，不可數不可數為一不可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a28\">0238a28</span>數轉，不可數轉不可數轉為一不可稱，不可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238a29\">0238a29</span>稱不可稱為一不可稱轉，不可稱轉不可稱\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b01\">0238b01</span>轉為一不可思，不可思不可思為一不可思\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b02\">0238b02</span>轉，不可思轉不可思轉為一不可量，不可量\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b03\">0238b03</span>不可量為一不可量轉，不可量轉不可量轉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b04\">0238b04</span>為一不可說，不可說不可說為一不可說轉，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b05\">0238b05</span>不可說轉不可說轉為一不可說不可說，此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b06\">0238b06</span>又不可說不可說為一不可說不可說轉。」</p><p>爾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b07\">0238b07</span>時，世尊為心王菩薩而說頌<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0238002\">曰＝言【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0238002\">曰【大】，言【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0238002\"><p class=\"lg\">曰</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">言</rdg></app>：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b08\">0238b08</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「不可言說不可說，<caesura/>充滿一切不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b09\">0238b09</span><p class=\"lg\">不可言說諸劫中，<caesura/>說不可說不可盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b10\">0238b10</span><p class=\"lg\">不可言說諸佛剎，<caesura/>皆悉碎末為微塵，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b11\">0238b11</span><p class=\"lg\">一塵中剎不可說，<caesura/>如一一切皆如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b12\">0238b12</span><p class=\"lg\">此不可說諸佛剎，<caesura/>一念碎塵不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b13\">0238b13</span><p class=\"lg\">念念所碎悉亦然，<caesura/>盡不可說劫恒爾。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b14\">0238b14</span><p class=\"lg\">此塵有剎不可說，<caesura/>此剎為塵說更難，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b15\">0238b15</span><p class=\"lg\">以不可說算數法，<caesura/>不可說劫如是數。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b16\">0238b16</span><p class=\"lg\">以此諸塵數諸劫，<caesura/>一塵十萬不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b17\">0238b17</span><p class=\"lg\">爾劫稱讚一普賢，<caesura/>無能盡其功德量。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b18\">0238b18</span><p class=\"lg\">於一微細毛端處，<caesura/>有不可說諸普賢，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b19\">0238b19</span><p class=\"lg\">一切毛端悉亦爾，<caesura/>如是乃至遍法界。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b20\">0238b20</span><p class=\"lg\">一毛端處所有剎，<caesura/>其數無量不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b21\">0238b21</span><p class=\"lg\">盡虛空量諸毛端，<caesura/>一一處剎悉如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b22\">0238b22</span><p class=\"lg\">彼毛端處諸國土，<caesura/>無量種類差別住，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b23\">0238b23</span><p class=\"lg\">有不可說異類剎，<caesura/>有不可說同類剎。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b24\">0238b24</span><p class=\"lg\">不可言說毛端處，<caesura/>皆有淨剎不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b25\">0238b25</span><p class=\"lg\">種種莊嚴不可說，<caesura/>種種奇妙不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b26\">0238b26</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一毛端處，<caesura/>演不可說諸佛名，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b27\">0238b27</span><p class=\"lg\">一一名有諸如來，<caesura/>皆不可說不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b28\">0238b28</span><p class=\"lg\">一一諸佛於身上，<caesura/>現不可說諸毛孔，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238b29\">0238b29</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一毛孔中，<caesura/>現眾色相不可說。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c01\">0238c01</span><p class=\"lg\">不可言說諸毛孔，<caesura/>咸放光明不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c02\">0238c02</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一光明中，<caesura/>悉現蓮華不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c03\">0238c03</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一蓮華內，<caesura/>悉有眾葉不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c04\">0238c04</span><p class=\"lg\">不可說華眾葉中，<caesura/>各現色相不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c05\">0238c05</span><p class=\"lg\">彼不可說諸色內，<caesura/>復現眾葉不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c06\">0238c06</span><p class=\"lg\">葉中光明不可說，<caesura/>光中色相不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c07\">0238c07</span><p class=\"lg\">此不可說色相中，<caesura/>一一現光不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c08\">0238c08</span><p class=\"lg\">光中現月不可說，<caesura/>月復現月不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c09\">0238c09</span><p class=\"lg\">於不可說諸月中，<caesura/>一一現光不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c10\">0238c10</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一光明內，<caesura/>復現於日不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c11\">0238c11</span><p class=\"lg\">於不可說諸日中，<caesura/>一一現色不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c12\">0238c12</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一諸色內，<caesura/>又現光明不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c13\">0238c13</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一光明內，<caesura/>現不可說師子座，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c14\">0238c14</span><p class=\"lg\">一一嚴具不可說，<caesura/>一一光明不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c15\">0238c15</span><p class=\"lg\">光中妙色不可說，<caesura/>色中淨光不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c16\">0238c16</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一淨光內，<caesura/>復現種種妙光明。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c17\">0238c17</span><p class=\"lg\">此光復現種種光，<caesura/>不可言說不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c18\">0238c18</span><p class=\"lg\">如是種種光明內，<caesura/>各現妙寶如須彌。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c19\">0238c19</span><p class=\"lg\">一一光中所現寶，<caesura/>不可言說不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c20\">0238c20</span><p class=\"lg\">彼如須彌一妙寶，<caesura/>現眾剎土不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c21\">0238c21</span><p class=\"lg\">盡須彌寶無有餘，<caesura/>示現剎土皆如是，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c22\">0238c22</span><p class=\"lg\">以一剎土末為塵，<caesura/>一塵色相不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c23\">0238c23</span><p class=\"lg\">眾剎為塵塵有相，<caesura/>不可言說不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c24\">0238c24</span><p class=\"lg\">如是種種諸塵相，<caesura/>皆出光明不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c25\">0238c25</span><p class=\"lg\">光中現佛不可說，<caesura/>佛所說法不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c26\">0238c26</span><p class=\"lg\">法中妙偈不可說，<caesura/>聞偈得解不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c27\">0238c27</span><p class=\"lg\">不可說解念念中，<caesura/>顯了真諦不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c28\">0238c28</span><p class=\"lg\">示現未來一切佛，<caesura/>常演說法無窮盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0238c29\">0238c29</span><p class=\"lg\">一一佛法不可說，<caesura/>種種清淨不可說，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a01\">0239a01</span><p class=\"lg\">出妙音聲不可說，<caesura/>轉正法輪不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a02\">0239a02</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一法輪中，<caesura/>演修多羅不可說；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a03\">0239a03</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一修多羅，<caesura/>分別法門不可說；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a04\">0239a04</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一法門中，<caesura/>又說諸法不可說；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a05\">0239a05</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一諸法中，<caesura/>調伏眾生不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a06\">0239a06</span><p class=\"lg\">或復於一毛端處，<caesura/>不可說劫常安住，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a07\">0239a07</span><p class=\"lg\">如一毛端餘悉然，<caesura/>所住劫數皆如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a08\">0239a08</span><p class=\"lg\">其心無礙不可說，<caesura/>變化諸佛不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a09\">0239a09</span><p class=\"lg\">一一變化諸如來，<caesura/>復現於化不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a10\">0239a10</span><p class=\"lg\">彼佛法身不可說，<caesura/>彼佛分身不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a11\">0239a11</span><p class=\"lg\">莊嚴無量不可說，<caesura/>往詣十方不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a12\">0239a12</span><p class=\"lg\">周行國土不可說，<caesura/>觀察眾生不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a13\">0239a13</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨眾生不可說，<caesura/>調伏眾生不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a14\">0239a14</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸莊嚴不可說，<caesura/>彼諸神力不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a15\">0239a15</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸自在不可說，<caesura/>彼諸神變不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a16\">0239a16</span><p class=\"lg\">所有神通不可說，<caesura/>所有境界不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a17\">0239a17</span><p class=\"lg\">所有加持不可說，<caesura/>所住世間不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a18\">0239a18</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨實相不可說，<caesura/>說修多羅不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a19\">0239a19</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一修多羅，<caesura/>演說法門不可說；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a20\">0239a20</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一法門中，<caesura/>又說諸法不可說；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a21\">0239a21</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一諸法中，<caesura/>所有決定不可說；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a22\">0239a22</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼一一決定中，<caesura/>調伏眾生不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a23\">0239a23</span><p class=\"lg\">不可言說同類法，<caesura/>不可言說同類心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a24\">0239a24</span><p class=\"lg\">不可言說異類法，<caesura/>不可言說異類心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a25\">0239a25</span><p class=\"lg\">不可言說異類根，<caesura/>不可言說異類語，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a26\">0239a26</span><p class=\"lg\">念念於諸所行處，<caesura/>調伏眾生不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a27\">0239a27</span><p class=\"lg\">所有神變不可說，<caesura/>所有示現不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a28\">0239a28</span><p class=\"lg\">於中時劫不可說，<caesura/>於中差別不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239a29\">0239a29</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩悉能分別說，<caesura/>諸明算者莫能<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0239001\">辨＝辯【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0239001\">辨【大】，辯【宮】</span><app n=\"0239001\"><p class=\"lg\">辨</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">辯</rdg></app>。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b01\">0239b01</span><p class=\"lg\">一毛端處大小剎，<caesura/>雜染清淨麁細剎，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b02\">0239b02</span><p class=\"lg\">如是一切不可說，<caesura/>一一明了可分別。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b03\">0239b03</span><p class=\"lg\">以一國土碎為塵，<caesura/>其塵無量不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b04\">0239b04</span><p class=\"lg\">如是塵數無邊剎，<caesura/>俱來共集一毛端。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b05\">0239b05</span><p class=\"lg\">此諸國土不可說，<caesura/>共集毛端無迫隘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b06\">0239b06</span><p class=\"lg\">不使毛端有增大，<caesura/>而彼國土俱來集。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b07\">0239b07</span><p class=\"lg\">於中所有諸國土，<caesura/>形相如本無雜亂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b08\">0239b08</span><p class=\"lg\">如一國土不亂餘，<caesura/>一切國土皆如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b09\">0239b09</span><p class=\"lg\">虛空境界無邊際，<caesura/>悉布毛端使充滿，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b10\">0239b10</span><p class=\"lg\">如是毛端諸國土，<caesura/>菩薩一念皆能說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b11\">0239b11</span><p class=\"lg\">於一微細毛孔中，<caesura/>不可說剎次第入，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b12\">0239b12</span><p class=\"lg\">毛孔能受彼諸剎，<caesura/>諸剎不能遍毛孔。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b13\">0239b13</span><p class=\"lg\">入時劫數不可說，<caesura/>受時劫數不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b14\">0239b14</span><p class=\"lg\">於此行列安住時，<caesura/>一切諸劫無能說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b15\">0239b15</span><p class=\"lg\">如是攝受安住已，<caesura/>所有境界不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b16\">0239b16</span><p class=\"lg\">入時方便不可說，<caesura/>入已所作不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b17\">0239b17</span><p class=\"lg\">意根明了不可說，<caesura/>遊<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0239002\">歷＝塵【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0239002\">歷【大】，塵【聖】</span><app n=\"0239002\"><p class=\"lg\">歷</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">塵</rdg></app>諸方不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b18\">0239b18</span><p class=\"lg\">勇猛精進不可說，<caesura/>自在神變不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b19\">0239b19</span><p class=\"lg\">所有思惟不可說，<caesura/>所有大願不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b20\">0239b20</span><p class=\"lg\">所有境界不可說，<caesura/>一切通達不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b21\">0239b21</span><p class=\"lg\">身業清淨不可說，<caesura/>語業清淨不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b22\">0239b22</span><p class=\"lg\">意業清淨不可說，<caesura/>信解清淨不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b23\">0239b23</span><p class=\"lg\">妙智清淨不可說，<caesura/>妙慧清淨不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b24\">0239b24</span><p class=\"lg\">了諸實相不可說，<caesura/>斷諸疑惑不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b25\">0239b25</span><p class=\"lg\">出離生死不可說，<caesura/>超<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0239003\">昇＝升【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0239003\">昇【大】，升【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0239003\"><p class=\"lg\">昇</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">升</rdg></app>正位不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b26\">0239b26</span><p class=\"lg\">甚深三昧不可說，<caesura/>了達一切不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b27\">0239b27</span><p class=\"lg\">一切眾生不可說，<caesura/>一切佛剎不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b28\">0239b28</span><p class=\"lg\">知眾生身不可說，<caesura/>知其心樂不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239b29\">0239b29</span><p class=\"lg\">知其業果不可說，<caesura/>知其意解不可說，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c01\">0239c01</span><p class=\"lg\">知其品類不可說，<caesura/>知其種性不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c02\">0239c02</span><p class=\"lg\">知其受身不可說，<caesura/>知其生處不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c03\">0239c03</span><p class=\"lg\">知其正生不可說，<caesura/>知其生已不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c04\">0239c04</span><p class=\"lg\">知其解了不可說，<caesura/>知其趣向不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c05\">0239c05</span><p class=\"lg\">知其言語不可說，<caesura/>知其作業不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c06\">0239c06</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩如是大慈悲，<caesura/>利益一切諸世間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c07\">0239c07</span><p class=\"lg\">普現其身不可說，<caesura/>入諸佛剎不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c08\">0239c08</span><p class=\"lg\">見諸菩薩不可說，<caesura/>發生智慧不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c09\">0239c09</span><p class=\"lg\">請問正法不可說，<caesura/>敷揚佛教不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c10\">0239c10</span><p class=\"lg\">現種種身不可說，<caesura/>詣諸國土不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c11\">0239c11</span><p class=\"lg\">示現神通不可說，<caesura/>普遍十方不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c12\">0239c12</span><p class=\"lg\">處處分身不可說，<caesura/>親近諸佛不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c13\">0239c13</span><p class=\"lg\">作諸供具不可說，<caesura/>種種無量不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c14\">0239c14</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨眾寶不可說，<caesura/>上妙蓮華不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c15\">0239c15</span><p class=\"lg\">最勝香鬘不可說，<caesura/>供養如來不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c16\">0239c16</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨信心不可說，<caesura/>最勝悟解不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c17\">0239c17</span><p class=\"lg\">增上志樂不可說，<caesura/>恭敬諸佛不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c18\">0239c18</span><p class=\"lg\">修行於施不可說，<caesura/>其心過去不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c19\">0239c19</span><p class=\"lg\">有求皆施不可說，<caesura/>一切悉施不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c20\">0239c20</span><p class=\"lg\">持戒清淨不可說，<caesura/>心意清淨不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c21\">0239c21</span><p class=\"lg\">讚歎諸佛不可說，<caesura/>愛樂正法不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c22\">0239c22</span><p class=\"lg\">成就諸忍不可說，<caesura/>無生法忍不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c23\">0239c23</span><p class=\"lg\">具足寂靜不可說，<caesura/>住寂靜地不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c24\">0239c24</span><p class=\"lg\">起大精進不可說，<caesura/>其心過去不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c25\">0239c25</span><p class=\"lg\">不退轉心不可說，<caesura/>不傾動心不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c26\">0239c26</span><p class=\"lg\">一切定藏不可說，<caesura/>觀察諸法不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c27\">0239c27</span><p class=\"lg\">寂然在定不可說，<caesura/>了達諸禪不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c28\">0239c28</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧通達不可說，<caesura/>三昧自在不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0239c29\">0239c29</span><p class=\"lg\">了達諸法不可說，<caesura/>明見諸佛不可說，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a01\">0240a01</span><p class=\"lg\">修無量行不可說，<caesura/>發廣大願不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a02\">0240a02</span><p class=\"lg\">甚深境界不可說，<caesura/>清淨法門不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a03\">0240a03</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩法力不可說，<caesura/>菩薩法住不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a04\">0240a04</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸正念不可說，<caesura/>彼諸法界不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a05\">0240a05</span><p class=\"lg\">修方便智不可說，<caesura/>學甚深智不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a06\">0240a06</span><p class=\"lg\">無量智慧不可說，<caesura/>究竟智慧不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a07\">0240a07</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸法智不可說，<caesura/>彼淨法輪不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a08\">0240a08</span><p class=\"lg\">彼大法雲不可說，<caesura/>彼大法雨不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a09\">0240a09</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸神力不可說，<caesura/>彼諸方便不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a10\">0240a10</span><p class=\"lg\">入空寂智不可說，<caesura/>念念相續不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a11\">0240a11</span><p class=\"lg\">無量行門不可說，<caesura/>念念<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0240001\">恒＝性【宋】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0240001\">恒【大】，性【宋】</span><app n=\"0240001\"><p class=\"lg\">恒</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】\">性</rdg></app>住不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a12\">0240a12</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛剎海不可說，<caesura/>悉能往詣不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a13\">0240a13</span><p class=\"lg\">諸剎差別不可說，<caesura/>種種清淨不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a14\">0240a14</span><p class=\"lg\">差別莊嚴不可說，<caesura/>無邊色相不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a15\">0240a15</span><p class=\"lg\">種種間錯不可說，<caesura/>種種妙好不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a16\">0240a16</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨佛土不可說，<caesura/>雜染世界不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a17\">0240a17</span><p class=\"lg\">了知眾生不可說，<caesura/>知其種性不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a18\">0240a18</span><p class=\"lg\">知其業報不可說，<caesura/>知其心行不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a19\">0240a19</span><p class=\"lg\">知其根性不可說，<caesura/>知其解欲不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a20\">0240a20</span><p class=\"lg\">雜染清淨不可說，<caesura/>觀察調伏不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a21\">0240a21</span><p class=\"lg\">變化自在不可說，<caesura/>現種種身不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a22\">0240a22</span><p class=\"lg\">修行精進不可說，<caesura/>度脫眾生不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a23\">0240a23</span><p class=\"lg\">示現神變不可說，<caesura/>放大光明不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a24\">0240a24</span><p class=\"lg\">種種色相不可說，<caesura/>令眾生淨不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a25\">0240a25</span><p class=\"lg\">一一毛孔不可說，<caesura/>放光明網不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a26\">0240a26</span><p class=\"lg\">光網現色不可說，<caesura/>普照佛剎不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a27\">0240a27</span><p class=\"lg\">勇猛無畏不可說，<caesura/>方便善巧不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a28\">0240a28</span><p class=\"lg\">調伏眾生不可說，<caesura/>令出生死不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240a29\">0240a29</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨身業不可說，<caesura/>清淨語業不可說，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b01\">0240b01</span><p class=\"lg\">無邊意業不可說，<caesura/>殊勝妙行不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b02\">0240b02</span><p class=\"lg\">成就智寶不可說，<caesura/>深入法界不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b03\">0240b03</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩總持不可說，<caesura/>善能修學不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b04\">0240b04</span><p class=\"lg\">智者音聲不可說，<caesura/>音聲清淨不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b05\">0240b05</span><p class=\"lg\">正念真實不可說，<caesura/>開悟眾生不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b06\">0240b06</span><p class=\"lg\">具足威儀不可說，<caesura/>清淨修行不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b07\">0240b07</span><p class=\"lg\">成就無畏不可說，<caesura/>調伏世間不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b08\">0240b08</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛子眾不可說，<caesura/>清淨勝行不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b09\">0240b09</span><p class=\"lg\">稱歎諸佛不可說，<caesura/>讚揚無盡不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b10\">0240b10</span><p class=\"lg\">世間導師不可說，<caesura/>演說讚歎不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b11\">0240b11</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸菩薩不可說，<caesura/>清淨功德不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b12\">0240b12</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸邊際不可說，<caesura/>能住其中不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b13\">0240b13</span><p class=\"lg\">住中智慧不可說，<caesura/>盡諸劫住無能說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b14\">0240b14</span><p class=\"lg\">欣樂諸佛不可說，<caesura/>智慧平等不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b15\">0240b15</span><p class=\"lg\">善入諸法不可說，<caesura/>於法無礙不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b16\">0240b16</span><p class=\"lg\">三世如空不可說，<caesura/>三世智慧不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b17\">0240b17</span><p class=\"lg\">了達三世不可說，<caesura/>住於智慧不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b18\">0240b18</span><p class=\"lg\">殊勝妙行不可說，<caesura/>無量大願不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b19\">0240b19</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨大願不可說，<caesura/>成就菩提不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b20\">0240b20</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛菩提不可說，<caesura/>發生智慧不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b21\">0240b21</span><p class=\"lg\">分別義理不可說，<caesura/>知一切法不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b22\">0240b22</span><p class=\"lg\">嚴淨佛剎不可說，<caesura/>修行諸力不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b23\">0240b23</span><p class=\"lg\">長時修習不可說，<caesura/>一念悟解不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b24\">0240b24</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛自在不可說，<caesura/>廣演正法不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b25\">0240b25</span><p class=\"lg\">種種神力不可說，<caesura/>示現世間不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b26\">0240b26</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨法輪不可說，<caesura/>勇猛能轉不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b27\">0240b27</span><p class=\"lg\">種種開演不可說，<caesura/>哀愍世間不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b28\">0240b28</span><p class=\"lg\">不可言說一切劫，<caesura/>讚不可說諸功德，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240b29\">0240b29</span><p class=\"lg\">不可說劫猶可盡，<caesura/>不可說德不可盡。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c01\">0240c01</span><p class=\"lg\">不可言說諸如來，<caesura/>不可言說諸舌根，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c02\">0240c02</span><p class=\"lg\">歎佛不可言說德，<caesura/>不可說劫無能盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c03\">0240c03</span><p class=\"lg\">十方所有諸眾生，<caesura/>一切同時成正覺，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c04\">0240c04</span><p class=\"lg\">於中一佛普能現，<caesura/>不可言說一切身。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c05\">0240c05</span><p class=\"lg\">此不可說中一身，<caesura/>示現於頭不可說；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c06\">0240c06</span><p class=\"lg\">此不可說中一頭，<caesura/>示現於舌不可說；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c07\">0240c07</span><p class=\"lg\">此不可說中一舌，<caesura/>示現於聲不可說；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c08\">0240c08</span><p class=\"lg\">此不可說中一聲，<caesura/>經於劫住不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c09\">0240c09</span><p class=\"lg\">如一如是一切佛，<caesura/>如一如是一切身，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c10\">0240c10</span><p class=\"lg\">如一如是一切頭，<caesura/>如一如是一切舌，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c11\">0240c11</span><p class=\"lg\">如一如是一切聲，<caesura/>不可說劫恒讚佛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c12\">0240c12</span><p class=\"lg\">不可說劫猶可盡，<caesura/>歎佛功德無能盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c13\">0240c13</span><p class=\"lg\">一微塵中能悉有，<caesura/>不可言說蓮華界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c14\">0240c14</span><p class=\"lg\">一一蓮華世界中，<caesura/>賢首如來不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c15\">0240c15</span><p class=\"lg\">乃至法界悉周遍，<caesura/>其中所有諸微塵，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c16\">0240c16</span><p class=\"lg\">世界若成若住壞，<caesura/>其數無量不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c17\">0240c17</span><p class=\"lg\">一微塵處無邊際，<caesura/>無量諸剎普<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0240002\">來入＝入來【明】，明註曰入來南藏作來入</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0240002\">來入【大】，入來【明】，明註曰入來南藏作來入</span><app n=\"0240002\"><p class=\"lg\">來入</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">入來</rdg><rdg resp=\"【明】\" wit=\"【南藏】\">來入</rdg></app>，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c18\">0240c18</span><p class=\"lg\">十方差別不可說，<caesura/>剎海分布不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c19\">0240c19</span><p class=\"lg\">一一剎中有如來，<caesura/>壽命劫數不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c20\">0240c20</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛所行不可說，<caesura/>甚深妙法不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c21\">0240c21</span><p class=\"lg\">神通大力不可說，<caesura/>無障礙智不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c22\">0240c22</span><p class=\"lg\">入於毛孔不可說，<caesura/>毛孔因緣不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c23\">0240c23</span><p class=\"lg\">成就十力不可說，<caesura/>覺悟菩提不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c24\">0240c24</span><p class=\"lg\">入淨法界不可說，<caesura/>獲深智藏不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c25\">0240c25</span><p class=\"lg\">種種數量不可說，<caesura/>如其一切悉了知；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c26\">0240c26</span><p class=\"lg\">種種形量不可說，<caesura/>於此靡不皆通達。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c27\">0240c27</span><p class=\"lg\">種種三昧不可說，<caesura/>悉能經劫於中住，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c28\">0240c28</span><p class=\"lg\">於不可說諸佛所，<caesura/>所行清淨不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0240c29\">0240c29</span><p class=\"lg\">得不可說無礙心，<caesura/>往詣十方不可說，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a01\">0241a01</span><p class=\"lg\">神力示現不可說，<caesura/>所行無際不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a02\">0241a02</span><p class=\"lg\">往詣眾剎不可說，<caesura/>了達諸佛不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a03\">0241a03</span><p class=\"lg\">精進勇猛不可說，<caesura/>智慧通達不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a04\">0241a04</span><p class=\"lg\">於法非行非不行，<caesura/>入諸境界不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a05\">0241a05</span><p class=\"lg\">不可稱說諸大劫，<caesura/>恒遊十方不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a06\">0241a06</span><p class=\"lg\">方便智慧不可說，<caesura/>真實智慧不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a07\">0241a07</span><p class=\"lg\">神通智慧不可說，<caesura/>念念示現不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a08\">0241a08</span><p class=\"lg\">於不可說諸佛法，<caesura/>一一了知不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a09\">0241a09</span><p class=\"lg\">能於一時證菩提，<caesura/>或種種時而證入。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a10\">0241a10</span><p class=\"lg\">毛端佛剎不可說，<caesura/>塵中佛剎不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a11\">0241a11</span><p class=\"lg\">如是佛剎皆往詣，<caesura/>見諸如來不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a12\">0241a12</span><p class=\"lg\">通達一實不可說，<caesura/>善入佛種不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a13\">0241a13</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛國土不可說，<caesura/>悉能往詣成菩提。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a14\">0241a14</span><p class=\"lg\">國土眾生及諸佛，<caesura/>體性差別不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a15\">0241a15</span><p class=\"lg\">如是三世無有邊，<caesura/>菩薩一切皆明見。」</p></lg></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a16\">0241a16</span><cb:div type=\"pin\"><cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"31\" type=\"品\">31 壽量品</cb:mulu><head><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0241a1601\">［－］【CB】，大方廣佛華嚴經【大】</span><app n=\"0241a1601\"><p class=\"lg\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">大方廣佛華嚴經</rdg></app>壽量品第三十一</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a17\">0241a17</span><p>爾時，心王菩薩摩訶薩於眾會中告諸菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a18\">0241a18</span>言：「佛子！此娑婆世界釋迦牟尼佛剎一劫，於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a19\">0241a19</span>極樂世界阿彌陀佛剎為一日一夜；極樂世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a20\">0241a20</span>界一劫，於袈裟幢世界金剛堅佛剎為一日\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a21\">0241a21</span>一夜；袈裟幢世界一劫，於不退轉音聲輪世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a22\">0241a22</span>界善勝光明蓮華開敷佛剎為一日一夜；不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a23\">0241a23</span>退轉音聲輪世界一劫，於離垢世界法幢佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a24\">0241a24</span>剎為一日一夜；離垢世界一劫，於善燈世界\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a25\">0241a25</span>師子佛剎為一日一夜；善燈世界一劫，於妙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a26\">0241a26</span>光明世界光明藏佛剎為一日一夜；妙光明\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a27\">0241a27</span>世界一劫，於難超過世界法光明蓮華開敷佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a28\">0241a28</span>剎為一日一夜；難超過世界一劫，於莊嚴慧\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241a29\">0241a29</span>世界一切神通光明佛剎為一日一夜；莊嚴\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b01\">0241b01</span>慧世界一劫，於鏡光明世界月智佛剎為一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b02\">0241b02</span>日一夜。佛子！如是次第，乃至過百萬阿僧祇\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b03\">0241b03</span>世界，最後世界一劫，於勝蓮華世界賢勝佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b04\">0241b04</span>剎為一日一夜，普賢菩薩及諸同行大菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b05\">0241b05</span>等充滿其中。」</p></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b06\">0241b06</span><cb:div type=\"pin\"><cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"32\" type=\"品\">32 諸菩薩住處品</cb:mulu><head><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0241b0601\">［－］【CB】，大方廣佛華嚴經【大】</span><app n=\"0241b0601\"><p class=\"lg\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">大方廣佛華嚴經</rdg></app>諸菩薩住處品第三十二</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b07\">0241b07</span><p>爾時，心王菩薩摩訶薩於眾會中告諸菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b08\">0241b08</span>言：</p><p>「佛子！東方有處，名：仙人山，從昔已來，諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b09\">0241b09</span>菩薩眾於中止住；現有菩薩，名：金剛勝，與其\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b10\">0241b10</span>眷屬、諸菩薩眾三百人俱，常在其中而演說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b11\">0241b11</span>法。南方有處，名：勝峯山，從昔已來，諸菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b12\">0241b12</span>眾於中止住；現有菩薩，名曰：法慧，與其眷\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b13\">0241b13</span>屬、諸菩薩眾五百人俱，常在其中而演說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b14\">0241b14</span>法。西方有處，名：金剛焰山，從昔已來，諸菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b15\">0241b15</span>薩眾於中止住；現有菩薩，名：精進無畏行，與\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b16\">0241b16</span>其眷屬、諸菩薩眾三百人俱，常在其中而演\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b17\">0241b17</span>說法。北方有處，名：香積山，從昔已來，諸菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b18\">0241b18</span>眾於中止住；現有菩薩，名曰：香象，與其眷\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b19\">0241b19</span>屬、諸菩薩眾三千人俱，常在其中而演說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b20\">0241b20</span>法。東北方有處，名：清涼山，從昔已來，諸菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b21\">0241b21</span>薩眾於中止住；現有菩薩，名：文殊師利，與其\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b22\">0241b22</span>眷屬、諸菩薩眾一萬人俱，常在其中而演說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b23\">0241b23</span>法。海中有處，名：金剛山，從昔已來，諸菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b24\">0241b24</span>眾於中止住；現有菩薩，名曰：法起，與其眷\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b25\">0241b25</span>屬、諸菩薩眾千二百人俱，常在其中而演\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b26\">0241b26</span>說法。東南方有處，名：支提山，從昔已來，諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b27\">0241b27</span>菩薩眾於中止住；現有菩薩，名曰：天冠，與其\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b28\">0241b28</span>眷屬、諸菩薩眾一千人俱，常在其中而演說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241b29\">0241b29</span>法。西南方有處，名：光明山，從昔已來，諸菩\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c01\">0241c01</span>薩眾於中止住；現有菩薩，名曰：賢勝，與其\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c02\">0241c02</span>眷屬、諸菩薩眾三千人俱，常在其中而演說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c03\">0241c03</span>法。西北方有處，名：香風山，從昔已來，諸菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c04\">0241c04</span>薩眾於中止住；現有菩薩，名曰：香光，與其\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c05\">0241c05</span>眷屬、諸菩薩眾五千人俱，常在其中而演\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c06\">0241c06</span>說法。</p><p>「大海之中復有住處，名：莊嚴窟，從昔\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c07\">0241c07</span>已來，諸菩薩眾於中止住。毘舍離南有一住\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c08\">0241c08</span>處，名：善住根，從昔已來，諸菩薩眾於中止\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c09\">0241c09</span>住。摩度羅城有一住處，名：滿足窟，從昔已來，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c10\">0241c10</span>諸菩薩眾於中止住。俱珍那城有一住處，名\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c11\">0241c11</span>曰：法座，從昔已來，諸菩薩眾於中止住。清淨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c12\">0241c12</span>彼岸城有一住處，名：目真隣陀窟，從昔已來，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c13\">0241c13</span>諸菩薩眾於中止住。摩蘭陀國有一住處，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c14\">0241c14</span>名：無礙龍王建立，從昔已來，諸菩薩眾於中\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c15\">0241c15</span>止住。甘菩遮國有一住處，名：出生慈，從昔\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c16\">0241c16</span>已來，諸菩薩眾於中止住。震旦國有一住\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c17\">0241c17</span>處，名：那羅延窟，從昔已來，諸菩薩眾於中止\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c18\">0241c18</span>住。<g ref=\"#CB00562\"/>勒國有一住處，名：牛頭山，從昔已來，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c19\">0241c19</span>諸菩薩眾於中止住。迦葉彌羅國有一住處，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c20\">0241c20</span>名曰：次第，從昔已來，諸菩薩眾於中止住。增\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c21\">0241c21</span>長歡喜城有一住處，名：尊者窟，從昔已來，諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c22\">0241c22</span>菩薩眾於中止住。菴浮梨摩國有一住處，名：\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c23\">0241c23</span>見億藏光明，從昔已來，諸菩薩眾於中止住。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c24\">0241c24</span>乾陀<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0241001\">羅＝眾【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0241001\">羅【大】，眾【宮】</span><app n=\"0241001\"><p class=\"lg\">羅</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">眾</rdg></app>國有一住處，名：苫婆羅窟，從昔已\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c25\">0241c25</span>來，諸菩薩眾於中止住。」</p></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0241c26\">0241c26</span><cb:juan n=\"045\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大方廣佛華嚴經</title>卷第四十五</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n</body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}